{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103501","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103501","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:1:1710350101:0":{"text":"ペギーが魔法の鎧に捕まると、激しく視界が揺れた末、元の場所に戻っていた。","source_cn":"佩吉被魔法盔甲逮个正着，一阵天旋地转后，她回到了原点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A82C4DBC16E0F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1710350103:0":{"text":"ペギーの足音で聖堂の鎧が目を覚まし、彼女は入口まで戻るしかなかった。","source_cn":"佩吉的脚步声唤醒了圣堂的盔甲，她只能避退回入口。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE143C22A469FC1B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1710350102:0":{"text":"ペギーは冷たい鎧に押さえつけられた。白い光に包まれたかと思うと、またスタート地点へ戻された。","source_cn":"冰冷的铠甲按住了佩吉，一阵白光过后，她又回到了起点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C36EEEFC7BC111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏文本":{"text":"黒画面テキスト","source":"黑屏文本","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}